<h1>For directors</h1>
<p>Most of the catalog is available for perusal online and for purchase from the publishers below. Score previews on each <a href="/works/">work page</a> open the full score on Issuu.</p>
<h2 class="section-title">Mass of the Americas</h2>
<p>Four editions: Extraordinary Form (Latin, 1962 Missal), Ordinary Form (Spanish, Latin, English, and Nahuatl), a hybrid Ordinary Form with Greek Kyrie and Latin Agnus Dei, and the parish edition for chorus and organ. Scores are licensed per printed copy and delivered electronically with a license to print; order enough for choir, conductor, and organist, sixteen at minimum. Perusal copies of any edition are free on request.</p>
<form class="form perusal" action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.materialsEmail }}" method="POST">
  <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Perusal request, Mass of the Americas">
  <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false">
  <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/directors/?sent=1">
  <input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
  <div class="two-up tight">
    <label>Your name<input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name"></label>
    <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></label>
    <label>Parish, cathedral, or organization<input type="text" name="organization"></label>
    <label>Your role<input type="text" name="title" placeholder="Music director, pastor, conductor"></label>
  </div>
  <fieldset><legend>Edition</legend>
    <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="edition" value="Extraordinary Form"> Extraordinary Form</label>
    <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="edition" value="Ordinary Form"> Ordinary Form</label>
    <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="edition" value="Hybrid"> Hybrid</label>
    <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="edition" value="Parish edition"> Parish edition</label>
  </fieldset>
  <label>Message<textarea name="message" rows="4"></textarea></label>
  <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Request a perusal copy</button>
  <p class="note sent" hidden>Thank you. Your request has been sent.</p>
</form>
<script>if(location.search.indexOf('sent=1')>-1){var s=document.querySelector('.sent');s.hidden=false;s.scrollIntoView();}</script>
